    e1Etiqueta: 'THE NEW THREAT', e1Titulo: 'Nobody breaks the encryption anymore. <em class="c-coral">They fake faces.</em>',
    e1Texto: 'Hong Kong, 2024. An Arup employee joins a video call with his CFO and several colleagues. None of them was real: all were made with AI.',
    e1Nombre: 'Chief Financial Officer', e1Nombre2: 'Accounts', e1Nombre3: 'Legal counsel', e1Vivo: 'LIVE', e1Sello: 'GENERATED BY AI',
    e1Dato: 'transferred in fifteen payments after that meeting.', e1Fuente: 'ARUP · HONG KONG POLICE · 2024',
    e2Etiqueta: 'THE FIGURES', e2Titulo: 'The risk is not only who listens. It is <em class="c-ambar">who speaks</em>.',
    e2C1: 'in internet crime losses reported in the US in 2024, up 33% on the year before.', e2C2: 'stolen in 2024 by people posing as a company, an authority or a relative.',
    e2C3: 'in payments the victims authorised themselves, deceived. United Kingdom, 2024.',
    e3Etiqueta: 'HOW YOU ARE HEARD', e3Titulo: 'An ordinary call can be <em class="c-ambar">overheard</em> along the way.',
    e3Texto: 'A phone call is only encrypted up to the cell tower. After that, it crosses networks neither of you controls.',
    e3N0: 'Your phone', e3N1: 'Mast', e3N2: 'Your carrier', e3N3: 'Between carriers', e3N4: 'Their phone',
    e3R1T: 'Fake mast.', e3R1: 'It poses as your carrier’s and forces 2G, which is far weaker.',
    e3R2T: 'Inside the carrier.', e3R2: 'Lawful-interception systems can be attacked. In 2024 it emerged that they had been.',
    e3R3T: 'SS7 and Diameter.', e3R3: 'They can divert calls and texts without properly checking who asks.',
    e3R4T: 'Spyware.', e3R4: 'Something like Pegasus sees everything before it is encrypted.',
    e4Etiqueta: 'THE ANSWER', e4Titulo: '<em class="c-verde">Only the two of you</em> can read it.', e4Tu: 'Your device', e4Su: 'Their device', e4Rele: 'Server: sees only bytes', e4Msg: 'We sign tomorrow at 10',
    e4P1T: 'Encrypted on your device.', e4P1: 'It leaves your device encrypted, and only the other device can open it.',
    e4P2T: 'No account, no number.', e4P2: 'Nothing that identifies you. Nothing that can leak.',
    e4P3T: 'Nothing stored.', e4P3: 'The conversation exists only on your two screens and disappears when you close it.',
    e4P4T: 'No one in between.', e4P4: 'On a computer, four words that only match if no one is in between.',
    e5Etiqueta: 'CHECK', e5Titulo: 'Looking real <em class="c-hielo">is not proof</em>.',
    e5Texto: 'During the video call, Elixire analyses the other person\'s face on your own device. If something is off, it tells you what to ask them to confirm it.',
    e5S1: 'Camera', e5S1v: 'Physical', e5S2: '3D depth', e5S2v: 'Yes', e5S3: 'Pulse in the skin', e5S3v: 'Detected', e5S4: 'Lips and voice', e5S4v: 'Match', e5R: 'Real person, live',
    e5Nota: 'It detects virtual cameras, photos, recorded videos and faces without depth. No test is infallible: if someone urgently asks for money, hang up and call them yourself.',
    e6Etiqueta: 'THE TECHNOLOGY', e6Titulo: 'Two locks. <em class="c-hielo">One conversation.</em>',
    e6Texto: 'Hybrid post-quantum encryption, in your browser: reading a conversation would mean breaking classical and post-quantum cryptography at the same time.',
    e6F1: 'Hybrid post-quantum key agreement, at the standard’s highest level.', e6F2: 'Post-quantum signatures on every key agreement.', e6F3: 'Encryption of every message, file, image and sound.',
    e6F4T: 'Every minute', e6F4: 'A fresh post-quantum key agreement and a different key for every message.',
    e6F5T: 'Constant rhythm', e6F5: 'Identical packets at a fixed pace: from outside, no one can tell when you speak.',
    e6F6T: 'No addresses', e6F6: 'The call goes through our server: neither of you sees the other’s address.',
    e6F7T: 'Up to 4K', e6F7: '1080p on phones and 4K on computers, adapting to the connection on its own.',
    e6F8T: 'Open source', e6F8: 'Published under the AGPL-3.0 licence: anyone can review it and check there are no backdoors. Every script carries its SHA-384 fingerprint.',
    e6Limite: 'What no tool can promise, neither can we: if a device is infected, whoever controls it sees what you see.',
    e7Etiqueta: 'AGAINST THE REST', e7Titulo: 'Your apps for daily life. <em class="c-hielo">Elixire for what counts.</em>', e7Texto: 'WhatsApp, Telegram and Signal are fine for everyday use. Elixire is for when you must confirm who is speaking, with no account and no history.',
    e7F1: 'No install, no sign-up', e7F2: 'No phone number needed', e7F4: 'Post-quantum encryption', e7Sin: 'No public deployment', e7F6: 'Spot a fake face in the call', no: 'No',
    e8Etiqueta: 'HOW IT WORKS', e8Titulo: 'As simple as <em class="c-verde">tapping a link</em>.',
    e8P1T: 'Invite.', e8P1: 'Tap “Invite to a call” and send it on WhatsApp.', e8P2T: 'Tap the link.', e8P2: 'Whoever receives it taps it and the call starts by itself.',
    e8P3T: 'Talk.', e8P3: 'Post-quantum end-to-end encryption. When you hang up, nothing remains.',
    e9Titulo: 'If it matters, <em class="c-ambar">talk here</em>.',
    e9Texto: 'For a board meeting, a deal, a contract or a personal conversation that must stay between you. A paid service for individuals, law firms, clinics and companies. Unlimited during the trial phase.',
